{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55171","headline":"兵要望江南 医方第二十九（十六首） 十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 医方第二十九（十六首） 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山瘴气，岚谷用恒山。\n独头大蒜乌梅肉，速将酒煮便能痊，谨记此良言。\n（恒山二两，独头蒜一两，乌梅二十枚，咬咀，用酒二盏，煎至一大盏，分爲二服。\n初一服未发时吃，次一服已发时吃。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}